WEBVTT

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.500
Tencent Video presents.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.420
Adapted from the bestseller The King's Avatar
by Butterfly Blue.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.850
Copyright Notice
All rights preserved by China Literature

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.250
The world-popular eSport game Glory
has more than 130 million registered users.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:46.220
Now, Glory Professional Alliance season 8 is undergoing.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:53.650
On this stage of the highest level operations,
all Pro-Teams are determined to win.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.870
The war is in full swing.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:58.200
Who will be the final winner?

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.350
Let's wait and see.

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:10.300
Unfortunately, the most legendary player
Ye Qiu known as "Glory Textbook",

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.900
chose to retire during the winter transfers window in season 8.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.570
This is a big loss for the Pro-Alliance.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:21.770
His sudden retire-announcement has cost wide speculations.

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:26.870
One of the most popular theory is that
due to his age and declined performance,

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.250
for a better development of Excellent Era,
he decided to quit on his own accord.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:36.620
Ye Qiu's life after the retirement remains
to be the center of interest among the Glory fans.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:39.420
Fast run.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:40.370
Then high kick.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.020
Down with a hook punch.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:47.100
Bao Zi, a good use of the basic melee fighting skills
will get you into close combat with ranged classes,

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.050
so that you can smash them.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:55.020
The Pro Entrance Game that we'll participate
will determine the final winners based on team scores.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:57.070
Scores of the team events matter a lot.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.350
We have to nail this.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.700
Skills from a single class are somewhat
difficult to form consecutive hits.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.950
Only when different classes work well
together, can we get a perfect combo.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.400
Therefore lead to the most damage.

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:24.170
We will get into the Pro Entrance Game,
and eventually into the Pro Alliance.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:28.050
I think I'm on fire now.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:32.970
The things you hold onto are out of date.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.070
You could have had a perfect ending.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:38.420
Whether my ending's perfect or not, it's up to me to decide.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:40.870
I have nothing more to say.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.300
I will see you at the game.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:45.500
See you at the game.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.200
(Excellent Era)

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.850
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.720
The King's Avatar S2

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.950
(Five months earlier)

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.920
Boss, did you see that Dragon Raising Its Head?

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.570
You think that's Master Ye Qiu?

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.170
How would I know?

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:26.450
He didn't show his face.

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.420
But didn't he use the account of Tang?

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.270
Did she get a look at him?

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.250
Welcome to Happy Net Cafe.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.320
You go talk to Tang.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:34.300
Manager, you got computer available?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.450
Got customer, have to go.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:36.670
May I see your ID, please?

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.220
-Thank you.
-Go do your job then.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.300
Look, the star is back.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.000
Don't get me started.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.520
Who started this mess in the first place?

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:46.200
What time is it now?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.700
I'm not late for that, am I?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:48.350
Just at the right time.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.000
Boss, boss, it's about to be eight o'clock.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.870
Rush hour for Glory.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:53.650
We're all here.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:54.670
Waiting for you.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:55.670
Coming.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:56.420
Stop screaming.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.320
Ready?

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:58.820
Go.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.800
(You've logged in to Happy Net Cafe)

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.020
These guilds are all recruiting.

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.120
I'm a fan of Team Blue Rain.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:26.600
Let's go to Blue Brook.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:27.570
Sure.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.050
I love Huang Shaotian.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.100
You're not considering the three elite guilds, are you?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.050
Because right now Guild is on the lead.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.620
Happy?

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.970
Never heard of it.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.700
Well, have you heard of Lord Grim?

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:42.270
Lord Grim?

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:45.400
That Happy Guild, is ran by Lord Grim?

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.020
That Unspecialized with self-made Silver Weapon?

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:52.870
That famous master? Lord Grim?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:05:00.670
Happy Guild is open for recruitment!

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.120
Open window from a level four guild.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.650
Don't miss this.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.920
Want permanent attributes?

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:08.800
Want your name on the dungeon record?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.300
Wanna be in a team with Lord Grim?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.050
Do not hesitate. Click and join!

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.020
You got nothing to lose.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.650
And we got nothing to hide.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:18.500
Are we gonna do that as well?

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.850
You two!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:21.850
Don't just stand there and watch.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:23.300
Bao Zi.

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:24.800
I got two ones in.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.870
They're fans of the master.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.220
Nicely done, Little Moon.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.320
Don't you call me Little Moon!

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.800
You think the dungeon tonight's gonna go well?

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:38.370
Relax.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.500
I have a lot of friends coming.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:41.770
Friends?

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.470
Damn it.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.670
We have to stop Happy from developing.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:48.870
You think we should attack their members?

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:49.620
(Arisaema, guild leader of Herb Garden)

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:49.770
(Wandering Peak, guild leader of Tyranny)

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:50.770
(Arisaema, guild leader of Herb Garden)

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.820
(Changing Spring, guild leader of Blue Brook)

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:53.470
Not gonna work.

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:54.070
(Changing Spring, guild leader of Blue Brook)

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:55.170
We can't really go after them in public.

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:55.470
(Changing Spring, guild leader of Blue Brook)

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:57.920
We need to justify our actions.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.050
They're about to go into the Demon Dungeon, right?

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:08.170
You're talking about the Guardian Demon that will
give all guild members 8 attributes once it got cleared?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.050
That's it.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.270
All guilds can't level up until they clear that Guardian Demon.

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:17.570
Then we have to do our friend Lord Grim a favor.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:19.400
You think five's enough?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.150
Let's not be that stingy.

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:22.600
Let's make it 15.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.000
Sending spies to Happy?

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.120
I thought we were done with Lord Grim.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:31.070
(Changing Spring)

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.220
Things have changed.

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:33.600
He started his own guild.

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:34.850
He is now our direct rival.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.520
We can't run away from that.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.600
All three elite guilds will make their moves.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:40.650
We'll contact other guilds as well.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:41.900
Don't you worry about it.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:42.920
Just do what you can.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:44.680
Guys, you know the drill?

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.770
(Peerless Looks, Blue River's Smurf)

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:48.350
No.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.570
Please do help us.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.720
I'm a newcomer, you gotta help me.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:53.670
We are so getting you down.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:56.920
Sure.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.100
Make sure you follow my lead.

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:01.570
So these are your friends.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:05.670
Let's go.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.600
That's a long 10-minute.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.520
I can't wait to hear the result.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.420
I mean, you guys went for it.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.020
20 person dungeon, 15 spies?

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.300
Lord Grim's gonna lose it today.

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:25.920
Team One back to the original position.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:27.750
Team Two attack.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.400
Ranged classes hold on to your positions.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.800
Silly head, come attack me!

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:38.300
Damn it.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:39.700
His instructions are way too simple.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:40.900
I can't even make mistakes.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:42.950
Team Two, continue to attack.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.070
On it, on it.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.270
Team One cease fire.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.650
Take one step back.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.950
Lord Grim is even better than I thought he would be.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.470
What the heck is that launcher?

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:57.570
She is good!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.250
She's like a Pro player.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:08.470
Are they even humans?

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:09.800
That's ridiculous!

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:12.870
Lord Grim got the boss back.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.520
They're going to H&R the boss to death?

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:16.920
Holly crap.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.020
This ain't game.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.550
Oh my god.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.000
I wish I were dead.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.470
If we don't take our moves now, then
we're really helping him to clear the record.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.720
But we can't expose ourselves.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:30.820
So what should we do?

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:32.500
They are about to finish the boss!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:33.500
Cleansing Mist, continue with the range damage.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:34.450
Let's hope that they will make mistakes themselves.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.070
Get the boss at the center.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.020
Counting on those two making mistakes?

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:37.870
Soft Mist, back strike.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:38.850
It's on your right.
Unless miracle happens.

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:40.000
Unless miracle happens.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:42.470
Leader, what about me?

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:45.300
Make sure you stay behind me.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.120
We're running out of time.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:47.200
Damn it, let's do it.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.920
(Remove from the guild)

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.600
Player Condiment has been removed from the Guild by Lord Grim.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:08:59.920
What?

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.320
They got removed?

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:11.620
Don't make random moves.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:13.020
Wait for my instructions.

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:17.500
Lord Grim knew that we're spies?

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:21.570
Congratulations to Happy on defeating the Demon.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:25.850
You now have Demon Attributes: The Guarding Power.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:27.800
Appreciate your work.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.970
Without the helps from high-level players like you,

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.700
a small guild like us would never have done it.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.700
It's okay.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:35.020
We didn't do much.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.670
And next...

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.400
Next?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.900
Stay or leave, take your pick.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:50.720
The King's Avatar S2

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:54.560
(Five days later)

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:55.920
Damn it.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.570
Those spies didn't do shit.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:09:59.700
(Drink Alone,
Guild Leader from Samsara)
(Misty Lock,
Guild Leader from Misty Castle)

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:00.450
Tell me about it.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:00.680
(Drink Alone,
Guild Leader from Samsara)
(Misty Lock,
Guild Leader from Misty Castle)

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:03.300
I heard he even sent you thank-you letters?

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.120
That is awfully embarrassing.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:05.750
(Plantago Seed,
10th Server - Guild Leader of Blue Brook)

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:06.700
Don't beat around the bush.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:07.450
(Plantago Seed,
10th Server - Guild Leader of Blue Brook)

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.920
Didn't Samsara sent out spies either?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:09.350
(Plantago Seed,
10th Server - Guild Leader of Blue Brook)

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.020
I just wanna know about that Peerless Looks.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.270
I heard he is running Happy now?

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:16.020
It's not one of your accounts, is it?

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:18.370
(Blue River, member of Blue Brook)

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:21.500
Stay or leave, take your pick.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:29.300
One left.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:31.650
Peerless Looks, which guild you're from?

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:33.600
Should I pretend to be a newcomer?

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:35.670
Never mind.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:37.520
Blue Brook.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.620
Oh, you're Blue River.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:40.400
Seriously?

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.870
How can you even tell?

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:42.780
Took a wild guess.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.500
You've been exposed.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.670
Why did you choose to stay?

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:47.720
I got nothing to do anyway.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:48.720
Got nothing to do?

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:50.820
I can help you with that.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:56.550
All newcomers attention, this is our top nanny Peerless Looks.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.200
Go to him if you have any questions.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:01.060
No, wait!

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:02.750
I'm the spy!

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:05.170
I'm the 10th server guild leader of Blue Brook!

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:07.970
It's a long story.

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.900
Hey, what are Blue Brook and Misty Castle doing?

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.270
Happy poached two of your top-level players.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:14.600
Yeah.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:18.100
You can't lose high-end players like Hindsight and All-accomplished.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.170
You're feeding your rival.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.800
It's not like we want it to happen.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:22.720
I'm telling you.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.270
Lord Grim has been poaching everywhere.

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:27.750
I bet he is aiming at the level 40 Thousand Waves Lake's record clear.

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.250
So they got the dungeon team ready?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.320
You two guilds are pulling our legs.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:33.450
Shame on you.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:36.520
Well, you can't really blame us on this.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:37.900
What?

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.150
you got a reason for it?

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:40.020
You really wanna know?

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.420
Don't get jumped.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:44.970
Try me.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:47.820
Go ahead.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.200
Tell us.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:54.810
The leader of happy, Lord Grim...

00:11:56.350 --> 00:12:00.020
his name in real life is Ye Qiu.

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:01.420
What?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.300
The former captain of Excellent Era, Ye Qiu?

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.500
Seriously?

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:07.920
I can't believe it.

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:10.350
I can't believe I met the Master in Glory!

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.100
I'm in the game with the Pro-player master.
(Wandering Peak and Cold Night from Tyranny)

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:13.250
I fought with him!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:14.800
Lord Grim is Ye Qiu?

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:17.140
H-He is in this online game?

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.800
That's why All-accomplished bailed and joined Happy.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.220
All-accomplished, I want you to reconsider quitting the guild.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:27.450
Leader.

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:28.700
I only got one question.

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:29.870
Is Lord Grim really Ye Qiu?

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.020
Of course not.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.200
Don't listen to his bullshit.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:33.020
He's a fake.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:33.950
He is a complete liar.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.500
You're exactly the same as Ye Qiu told me.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.100
He told me to drop the question on you.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.850
He said you would definitely deny it.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:44.400
What?

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.920
Now that is low.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.450
Leader, I'm going there.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.600
No one likes me here anyway.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.300
All-accomplished...

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.750
Besides, that's Ye Qiu we're talking about!

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:54.800
He is my idol.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.770
Sorry, leader!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.370
Actually, I'm a big fan of Ye Qiu.

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:04.070
If I can really start the guild with him, that's really tempting.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.970
Ye Qiu is human too, no need to be afraid of him.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.150
Looks like Tyranny got something to say.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.120
We own this place.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:14.620
What if he is the master?

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.150
We work together, we can easily slay him.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:20.050
Don't ever forget our duties as guild leaders.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.800
Why is the progression in the 10th server not going anywhere?

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.750
Because Lord Grim holds the dungeon records.

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:30.000
That means he got all the guilds in his hand.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:32.670
Before he was only one.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.920
Now he got a guild to back him up.

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:38.220
You just gonna sit there and watch?

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.370
No!

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:40.950
We have to smash them.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.300
Got all their EXP.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.270
Drag him behind our schedule.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.070
So we're gonna go after them in public?

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:49.800
We don't have a good reason for it.

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:50.720
We can't do that.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:51.820
So what should we do?

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:52.670
All-accomplished.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:56.450
All-accomplished showed bad conduct in this game.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:57.570
He can be the target.

00:13:58.720 --> 00:13:59.950
He likes to Kill-Steal.

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:01.070
He got bad reputation.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.670
Everyone hates him.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.150
Let's go after him.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:04.870
Yeah.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.800
Under the name of justice.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:08.870
Happy allowed him to join in.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.320
We can work something on that as well.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.320
Go make some posts in the forum.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.350
Put his name on the notice.

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:13.770
Great.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.100
-- Get them down!
--That's right.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:15.870
Get Lord Grim down.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.320
That's right.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.350
Get Lord Grim down.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:18.750
Take our revenge.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.720
Total annihilation for Happy Joint announcement
from Blue Brook, Herb Garden, and Tyranny.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:22.320
All-accomplished kill-steal!

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.610
He's sick. He killed me three times yesterday.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:24.890
Happy's leader just gonna sit on this?

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:25.980
This is disgusting. I'm with the league.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:26.870
Happy is the tumor of 10th server!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.050
Get rid of Happy!

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:34.650
Look, it's All-accomplished.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.150
Herb Garden is over there.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.020
All guilds are pretty much here.

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:42.950
Got signs of Lord Grim?

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:43.970
Not here.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:45.250
We neither.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:48.250
Be careful with the ambush.

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:49.850
I certainly hope so.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:52.570
Leader...

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.700
he wants Happy to stand for All-Accomplished,

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:57.050
so that we can get into total conflict with Happy?

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:00.620
All these plots again.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.320
This is a tiny place.

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:02.900
I don't think they can ambush anything.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:04.770
Would it be in the water?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:05.920
They can't hide that long underwater.

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.370
We can observe almost the entire water area.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:11.700
They have nowhere to hide.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:12.820
That's it.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.120
Attack!

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:21.870
He got away.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:23.150
All-accomplished, way to go.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.470
Don't let him get away.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.450
Quick, get into the water.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.300
Quick, into the water.

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:34.920
Wait.

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:39.600
He's down.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:40.350
Where is he?

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:49.050
We got ambushed!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.050
Retreat! Retreat!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.020
How can they hide underwater?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.070
We didn't see them take the breath?

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:06.200
Well, it might have been an uncommon skill.

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:07.100
What's that?

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:08.900
I don't remember the name.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:10.650
It's a water-fight special technique.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:14.650
Hide underwater, flow with the waves,

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.320
raise your head slightly once a while to take a breath.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.170
Raise your head slightly once a while

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:22.220
to take a breath?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.370
This is Pro level technique.

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:27.120
It can't be...

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:33.820
Lord Grim!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.200
Cleansing Mist.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:36.570
It's an ambush.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:39.870
But we outnumber you.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.820
Bros, let's go get them!

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:45.820
What?

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.820
He can even calculate the trajectory on the water?

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:57.230
This is not gonna work.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:58.920
We can't find the Pros underwater.

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:00.470
Come on, let's get to the land.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:04.620
You're leaving?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.020
Let me give you a ride.

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:19.300
That is impressive.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.020
Don't just stand there!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:23.600
Get down there.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.650
Let's try the tag match.

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:26.200
Wear him out on oxygen.

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.150
Lord, Lord Grim!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.420
What did you do?

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:42.670
See you.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:49.600
Again?

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:03.970
Don't just be an audience.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:05.920
You go get Blue River.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.120
Don't just be a smurf and kill-steal.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:09.770
Do some real work.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:14.070
Leader?

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.750
I'm not your leader anymore!

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:44.930
(Warning: Low on oxygen)

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.100
Leader.

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.020
Our oxygen.

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.320
He wants to keep us underwater.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:50.450
He wants us to suffocate.

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:51.850
Retreat.

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:53.250
Let's head to the island at front.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:07.750
Blue River.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:16.800
You gonna let them walk?

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:20.170
Let them walk?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:21.700
Says who?

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:33.400
Welcome!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.100
Would you like to have some fresh bricks?

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:38.270
They got ambush on the shore!

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.220
Great timing for the doggies, little brother.

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.550
Well done.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.870
They are fire elves not dogs!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.750
And I'm not your brother!

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:17.350
I'm Concealed Light.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.600
This is not gonna do.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:19.670
We can't back off.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.700
Let's bring it on.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.400
I thought they are top-tiers.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:32.950
Man, you're weak.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:39.200
Leader!

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:41.070
They got into the water.

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.120
What should we do?

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:42.600
It's okay.

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:43.720
There is a boss underwater.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:45.820
Boss?

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:46.900
Then let's go get it!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:48.750
I don't think we can.

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:50.900
Why is that?

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:55.020
Because he's on our side.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:07.650
(Excellent Era)

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:10.900
Ye Qiu started a guild in the game?

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:11.970
Yes.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.150
A guild called Happy in the new server.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.000
It seems that he didn't give up.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.900
He is planning to come back.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.450
Getting those random nobodies in Glory.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:27.060
You don't really think this will
get you back to the Pro League...

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.170
Do you, Ye Qiu?

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:32.150
That was amazing.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:33.550
You kicked ass on all those guilds.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:36.050
And Happy's got a firm foothold in 10th server.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:39.550
This is a great step one.

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:42.420
The other guilds will be furious.

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:44.050
They will try to get back to us.

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:46.100
So what do we do?

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.600
Manager?

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.270
Can you come here a minute?

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:50.620
Sure, coming.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.850
There's something wrong with my computer.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.450
Did you try restart it?

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.220
No.

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:54.900
I'm in a game.

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.750
If Excellent Era didn't force him to retire,

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.550
he should be riding Battle God One Autumn Leaf,

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:04.850
fight in the Pro-Alliance against The Magician and Sword Saint.

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:07.570
Not being a manager here in a net cafe.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.870
We have to get to the Pro-Alliance.

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:19.310
(You've logged in to Happy Net Cafe)

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:22.200
Done.

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:23.050
Ye Xiu.

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:23.900
They are all gone.

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:25.350
We got them so hard.

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:27.450
I wonder if we hurt their feelings.

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:29.500
Well, I guess they just have to hold on there.

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:32.150
Because we're just getting started.

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:55.390
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:22:56.810 --> 00:23:00.520
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:05.350
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:07.520
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:12.140
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:14.100
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:16.220
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:18.390
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:23.100
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:26.390
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:23:26.390 --> 00:23:29.640
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:31.770
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:33.470
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:35.270
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.520
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:42.520
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:44.680
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:15.770
Master, let's call a truce.

00:24:16.170 --> 00:24:17.870
You got us on this one.

00:24:18.450 --> 00:24:19.770
Sure.

00:24:20.170 --> 00:24:21.070
I can take both checks and cash.

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:23.670
You might as well just rob us.

00:24:23.800 --> 00:24:25.070
With an enemy like this,

00:24:25.870 --> 00:24:27.620
all you can do is to back off.

00:24:28.020 --> 00:24:31.220
Whose side are you on?

00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:33.820
We're not paying you shit.

00:24:34.150 --> 00:24:37.150
Misty Castle, we got all these players,

00:24:37.150 --> 00:24:38.000
we'll smash you.

00:24:38.700 --> 00:24:39.400
Let's go.

00:24:40.320 --> 00:24:41.520
Happy New Year!
